-<section id="advanced"><div class="section-head"><h2>🧠 모델 및 가중치 설정</h2><span class="tag">ADVANCED</span></div><label class="detector-only">Base Model *<select name="detector_base_model" required><option value="small.pt">small.pt</option><option value="medium.pt">medium.pt</option><option value="large.pt">large.pt</option></select></label><label class="vlm-only" hidden>Base model / 가중치 경로 *<input name="vlm_base_model" maxlength="1024"></label><div class="row"><label>추가 가중치 경로 <span class="muted">선택</span><input name="weights" list="checkpoint-options" placeholder="/home/intellivix/train/Detector/runs/Detector/*.pt" maxlength="1024"><datalist id="checkpoint-options"></datalist></label><label>Optimizer<select name="optimizer"><option>AdamW</option><option>Adam</option><option>SGD</option></select></label></div><div class="resource-line checkpoint-line"><span>💾 체크포인트 기준 경로 <code>/home/intellivix/train/Detector/runs/Detector/</code></span><button id="refresh-checkpoints" type="button">새로고침</button></div><div class="vlm-only" hidden><div class="row"><label>Sequence length<input name="sequence_length" type="number" min="128" max="131072" value="2048"></label><label>Precision<select name="precision"><option>bf16</option><option>fp16</option><option>fp32</option></select></label></div><label class="check"><input name="lora_enabled" type="checkbox" checked> LoRA 파인튜닝 사용</label><div id="lora-fields" class="row triple"><label>LoRA rank<input name="lora_rank" type="number" min="1" max="1024" value="16"></label><label>LoRA alpha<input name="lora_alpha" type="number" min="1" max="4096" value="16"></label><label>LoRA dropout<input name="lora_dropout" type="number" min="0" max="0.99" step="0.01" value="0.05"></label></div></div><label class="check"><input name="resume" type="checkbox"> 체크포인트에서 학습 재개</label></section></form>
